{1}{So.  It seems we have a smart one, eh?  I've stood many nights here among the stones waiting for one such as you.  And yet, I hesitate...I've seen many fail.  You can still turn back...}{So.  It seems we have a smart one, eh?  I've stood many nights here among the stones waiting for one such as you.  And yet, I hesitate...I've seen many fail.  You can still turn back...}{}{}{}{}
{2}{I've come this far.  Let's finish this.}{}{5}{}{5}{}
{3}{Perhaps you're right.  I'll leave now.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{5}{Very well.  What's done is done and can be no other way.  Whatever the outcome, know that the stones and I and mine will remember you.}{Very well.  What's done is done and can be no other way.  Whatever the outcome, know that the stones and I and mine will remember you.}{}{}{}{}
{6}{Sure.  Sure.  Let's get to the question.}{}{5}{}{9}{}
{7}{Uh...I was wrong.  I'm leaving now.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{9}{Causing wounds, and cleansing.  History dies from its rinsing.  Life or scars is its blessing.  What am I?}{Causing wounds, and cleansing.  History dies from its rinsing.  Life or scars is its blessing.  What am I?}{}{}{}{}
{10}{Time.}{}{5}{}{}{qu1009 6, fl 20, co}
