{13}{Water.}{}{5}{}{}{qu1009 6, fl 20, co}
{14}{Memory.}{}{5}{}{}{qu1009 6, fl 20, co}
{16}{Well done, young one.  Few are those who win the old game--you have earned this prize.  Use it only in times of the gravest danger.  Remember us, and when you think you're alone...we will be there.}{Well done, young one.  Few are those who win the old game--you have earned this prize.  Use it only in times of the gravest danger.  Remember us, and when you think you're alone...we will be there.}{}{}{}{in -5700, gf2730 1, rp 1071}
{17}{Thank you.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{20}{WRONG.  WRONG.  WRONG.  The price must be paid.  In blood.}{WRONG.  WRONG.  WRONG.  The price must be paid.  In blood.}{}{}{}{}
{22}{No, not yet.  Seek the one of our kind who stands in the shallows just south of Black Root.  Perhaps later we shall speak.}{No, not yet.  Seek the one of our kind who stands in the shallows just south of Black Root.  Perhaps later we shall speak.}{}{}{}{}
{23}{Yes, you are a special one.  The old ways don't give to just anyone...}{Yes, you are a special one.  The old ways don't give to just anyone...}{}{}{}{}
{24}{No, I'm not yet the one.  Follow yon path to the Withered Grove, just south of here. }{No, I'm not yet the one.  Follow yon path to the Withered Grove, just south of here. }{}{}{}{}
